<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON THIRD DAY ORDER OF PLAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON THIRD DAY ORDER OF PLAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Order of play for singles matches</p>
<p>on top courts on Wednesday, the third day of Wimbledon (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Centre court (starts 1300GMT)</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S.) v Rachel McQuillan (Australia)</p>
<p>2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) v Magnus Norman (Sweden)</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) v Jerome Golmard (France)</p>
<p>Number One Court (starts 1300GMT)</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) v Wiltrud Probst (Germany)</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) v Jonathan Stark (U.S.)</p>
<p>Chris Wilkinson (Britain) v Mark Woodforde (Australia)</p>
<p>Number Two Court (starts 1100 GMT)</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) v Andrei Pavel (Romania)</p>
<p>9-Mary Pierce (France) v Dominique van Roost (Belgium)</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) v Justin Gimelstob (U.S.)</p>
</text>
